@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Filter orders (all filters are optional)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?departmentId=1&status=Planned&page=1&pageSize=25

### Order detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1

### Department choices
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/departments

### Product choices
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products

### Create; copy the returned orderId into the update request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "departmentId": 1,
  "quantityOrdered": 100,
  "dueDate": "2026-11-15"
}

### Update progress/status; replace 201 with the created orderId
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/201
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantityCompleted": 25,
  "status": "In Progress"
}

### Overdue incomplete orders; asOfDate is optional
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/order-exceptions?asOfDate=2026-11-02&page=1&pageSize=50

### Development OpenAPI document
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
